&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Analytics Engineer to bring robust, integrated data models and products to life within the VTEX Ads platform. You will be the data modeling reference point across the entire Ads ecosystem—advertisers, publishers, events (clicks, views, impressions), and performance—translating these domains into reliable data for product, client, data science, and business teams. From requirements gathering to production pipelines in our Lakehouse, you will ensure scalability and reliability for decisions that sustain the platform&#39;s operations and revenue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will join Campaign Intelligence, the newest team in our Data &amp;amp; Analytics organization, focused on the engine behind the VTEX Ads platform: pacing, target ROAS, budget forecasting, and auction optimization. We are responsible for structuring and serving this platform&#39;s data, giving product, data science, business teams, and clients reliable visibility into advertisers, publishers, and Ads performance—accelerating data-driven decisions on a global scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain robust, scalable analytical models in AWS Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in defining data requirements alongside product and technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop ingestion, transformation, and data modeling pipelines using the VTEX data platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support stakeholders with technical and analytical topics, translating needs into practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor performance, optimize queries, and ensure reliability across SQL and Python environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to spreading best practices and driving the evolution of the data stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with metrics and concepts from ad tech/martech platforms (campaign performance, attribution, ROAS/CTR/CPC, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in data modeling for large-scale analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with databases and data warehouses on AWS (Athena, Trino, Redshift, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL, Spark, and Python, along with query optimization skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with orchestration and data transformation tools (Airflow, Python, Spark, EMR, Glue, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AWS Cloud environments (preferably Redshift, S3, Glue, EMR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using GenAI tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Claude Code, ChatGPT) to accelerate daily development, debugging, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of semantic data layers (dbt semantic layer, LookML, Cube, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of software engineering is considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to engage both technical and business audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset, strong problem-solver, and results-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy, proactivity, and comfort working in dynamic, iterative environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative mindset with a strong focus on organizational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious mindset, always seeking to understand the &quot;why&quot; behind problems before proposing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About VTEX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c-mrkdwn__quote&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;quote&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;VTEX (NYSE: VTEX) is the composable and complete commerce platform that delivers more efficiency and less maintenance to organizations seeking to make smarter IT investments and modernize their tech stack. Through our pragmatic composability approach, we empower brands, distributors, and retailers with unparalleled flexibility and comprehensive solutions, enabling them to invest solely in what provides a clear business advantage and boosts profitability. VTEX is trusted by 2,400 global B2C and B2B customers, including Carrefour, Colgate, Motorola, Sony, Stanley Black &amp;amp; Decker, and Whirlpool, having 3,400 active online stores across 43 countries (as of FY ended on December 31, 2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c-mrkdwn__quote&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;quote&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Founded in the year 2000, VTEX has a history of being unstoppable. Completely against the odds, VTEX is leading a high-tech industry and positioned above market giants. We are building an extraordinary future with more than 1,300 employees scattered across 25 locations in 16 countries in Latin America, North America, Europe, and Asia. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vtex.com&quot;&gt;www.vtex.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c-mrkdwn__quote&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;quote&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At VTEX, you will work in a challenge-driven environment and collaborate with amazing peers. If you are powerful individually, join us, and we will be unstoppable together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Annual profit-sharing program and equity eligibility;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Health, dental, and life insurance with national coverage provided by VTEX;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Annual budget for professional development in Tech;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Language development incentive program (English, Spanish, Portuguese);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible meal allowance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Extended parental leaves;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Child-care assistance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible work schedule and remote-first culture;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Financial assistance to build your work-from-home setup;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Wellness program;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Free shipping on 1000+ VTEX stores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Most support engineers wait for the ticket. You won&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Field Software Engineer at VTEX, you are the technical face of the platform for a portfolio of enterprise brands and retailers. You work inside a cell — a small, dedicated squad that pairs you with our commercial team — so you know your customers&#39; businesses, their architectures, and their roadmaps before problems ever reach a queue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Your job is to unblock. When a customer hits a technical wall — a tricky integration, a performance bottleneck, a conflict between what they built and what the platform expects — you step in, diagnose it, and drive it to resolution. Sometimes that means writing code. Sometimes it means getting the right people in a room. Always, it means the customer moves forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a role for engineers who genuinely enjoy working with people. Deep VTEX technical knowledge is the entry ticket; a real vocation for service is what makes you great at it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is an in-office position based at your local VTEX office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;*For this position you are required to attend the office 4 days a week (Monday - Thursday), and remote work on Friday.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Unblock customers proactively: anticipate technical conflicts, identify risks in customer implementations, and resolve them before they become escalations — not just react to tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work embedded in a cell with our commercial team, partnering daily with Sales and Success on your shared portfolio and bringing the technical perspective to renewals, expansions, and strategic conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own complex technical cases end to end: debug, reproduce, and resolve implementation issues across the VTEX platform — storefront, APIs, integrations, checkout, and beyond — collaborating with customer and partner teams when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Be the customer&#39;s trusted technical advisor: guide them toward better architecture decisions, best practices, and platform capabilities they didn&#39;t know they had.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Feed what you learn back into VTEX by turning recurring issues into documentation, product feedback, and playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building or implementing on the VTEX platform is a must — you know VTEX IO / FastStore, Master Data, the core APIs, and how a VTEX store actually works in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Knowledge of REST APIs and GraphQL, and familiarity with debugging tools like Chrome DevTools and Postman.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A genuine vocation for service — you find satisfaction in solving someone else&#39;s problem, and customers feel it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills: you can explain a technical root cause to a developer and to a business stakeholder in the same meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A self-taught, proactive mindset — you ask probing questions, validate assumptions, and go find the answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;English (working proficiency)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Digital commerce experience beyond VTEX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;SEO and front-end performance optimization knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Degree in Engineering, Computer Science, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About VTEX&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;VTEX (NYSE: VTEX) is the composable and complete commerce platform that delivers more efficiency and less maintenance to organizations seeking to make smarter IT investments and modernize their tech stack. Through our pragmatic composability approach, we empower brands, distributors, and retailers with unparalleled flexibility and comprehensive solutions, enabling them to invest solely in what provides a clear business advantage and boosts profitability. VTEX is trusted by 2.400 global B2C and B2B customers, including Carrefour, Colgate, Motorola, Sony, Stanley Black &amp;amp; Decker, and Whirlpool, having 3.400 active online stores across 43 countries (as of FY ended on December 31, 2024).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Founded in the year 2000, VTEX has a history of being unstoppable. Completely against the odds, VTEX is leading a high-tech industry and positioned above market giants. We are building an extraordinary future with more than 1,300 employees scattered across 25 locations in 16 countries in Latin America, North America, Europe, and Asia. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vtex.com&quot;&gt;www.vtex.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At VTEX, you will work in a challenge-driven environment and collaborate with amazing peers. If you are powerful individually, join us, and we will be unstoppable together.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SOBRE A VTEX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;VTEX é a plataforma de comércio completa que proporciona mais eficiência e menos manutenção para organizações que buscam fazer investimentos mais inteligentes em TI e modernizar sua estrutura de tecnologia. Através da nossa abordagem pragmática, capacitamos marcas, distribuidores e varejistas com uma flexibilidade incomparável e soluções abrangentes, permitindo que invistam apenas no que oferece uma vantagem clara para o negócio e aumenta a lucratividade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;750&quot;&gt;A VTEX é confiada por 2.400 clientes globais B2C e B2B, incluindo Carrefour, Colgate, Motorola, Sony, Stanley Black &amp;amp; Decker e Whirlpool, operando 3.400 lojas online ativas em 43 países (dados do ano fiscal encerrado em 31 de dezembro de 2024).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;752&quot; data-end=&quot;1201&quot;&gt;Fundada no ano 2000, a VTEX tem uma trajetória de crescimento imbatível. Desafiando todas as probabilidades, estamos liderando a indústria de alta tecnologia e nos posicionando acima de gigantes do mercado. Estamos construindo um futuro extraordinário com mais de 1.300 colaboradores distribuídos por 25 localidades em 16 países da América Latina, América do Norte, Europa e Ásia. Para mais informações, visite &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vtex.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;www.vtex.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1203&quot; data-end=&quot;1376&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Na VTEX, você trabalhará em um ambiente dinâmico e desafiador, colaborando com colegas incríveis. Se você tem força individual, junte-se a nós e, juntos, seremos imparáveis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INCLUSÃO E ACESSIBILIDADE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Na VTEX, valorizamos a diversidade em todas as suas formas e acreditamos que a inclusão é essencial para o nosso sucesso. Esta vaga é afirmativa para pessoas com deficiência (PCD) como parte do nosso compromisso em promover um ambiente de trabalho diverso e inclusivo. Acreditamos na geração de oportunidades como ferramenta de mudança e estamos focados em encontrar talentos diversos para nossos times! &amp;nbsp;Estamos comprometidos em adaptar nossas instalações e ferramentas para garantir a acessibilidade de todos os nossos colaboradores, bem como dos candidatos do processo seletivo. Se você precisar de alguma adequação especial para participar do nosso processo seletivo, por favor, nos informe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principais áreas que recrutamos:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financeiro&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recursos Humanos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jurídico&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tecnologia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Essa é nosso banco de talentos de Diversidade, focado em Inclusão de Pessoas com Deficiência. Nosso time de Recrutamento está constantemente revisando os currículos que chegarem por aqui, e quando identificamos uma ótima oportunidade, entramos em contato com as pessoas para que elas participem do nosso processo de recrutamento.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quem pode se inscrever?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Todas as pessoas com deficiência podem se inscrever nessa página e em qualquer outra vaga na nossa página de carreiras. Aqui, seu perfil será revisado e, se houver compatibilidade, encaminhado para áreas nas quais estamos contratando. Caso você não se identifique como uma pessoa com deficiência, confira nossas outras oportunidades na&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/vtex&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;página de carreiras da VTEX&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefícios oferecidos:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Programa anual de participação nos lucros e elegibilidade para ações;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Plano de saúde, odontológico e seguro de vida com cobertura nacional fornecido pela VTEX;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Programa de incentivo ao desenvolvimento de idiomas (Inglês, Espanhol, Português);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Vale-refeição flexível;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Licenças parentais estendidas;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Auxílio-creche;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Horário de trabalho flexível e cultura de trabalho híbrido;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Assistência financeira para montar sua estação de trabalho em casa;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Programa de bem-estar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(247, 25, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Frete grátis em mais de 1.000 lojas clientes da VTEX.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The Commerce Engineer team is the support and engine of the VTEX Sales Team. The team seeks to guide and find scalable solutions for our potential customers. The team is trained and prepared to define the project scope, technical proposal, and pricing to reinforce the Sales team approach.Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;br&gt;Build and maintain strong, strategic relationships with large enterprise clients, ensuring consistent and high-level communication.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*This role requires you to be based in Barcelona, and to attend the office 4 days a week (Monday–Thursday), with remote work on Fridays.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
