&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;President of B2B - North America&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the ultimate executive leader responsible for the strategy, growth, profitability (P&amp;amp;L), and market penetration of VTEX&#39;s B2B business across the United States and Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Chief Revenue Officer, your mission will be to orchestrate a flawless Go-To-Market machine by unifying the Sales and Marketing organizations under your leadership. You will be the ultimate owner of maximizing our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Contract Value (ACV)&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring that every demand generation initiative translates into tangible pipeline, account acquisition, and Enterprise expansion. You will serve as the face of VTEX to C-level executives at B2B corporations and define the standard of excellence for corporate commerce in the region.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. ACV, Sales, and Marketing Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACV Growth Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: Aggressively lead the value capture strategy, acting as the ultimate executive responsible for the sustained acceleration of the region&#39;s Annual Contract Value (ACV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Go-To-Market Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Provide unified direction for the Enterprise Sales and B2B Marketing teams. You will eliminate silos to ensure that demand generation, brand positioning, and deal closures operate as a single, high-performance revenue engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Team Direction&lt;/strong&gt;: Attract, align, and mentor leaders across Sales, B2B Marketing, Business Development, and Customer Success throughout North America.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. Executive Strategy &amp;amp; P&amp;amp;L&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P&amp;amp;L Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Govern the financial outcomes of the B2B business unit, optimizing marketing spend (CAC), net revenue retention (NRR), and the overall profitability of the operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Closing&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively participate as the Executive Sponsor in complex negotiations, securing multi-year, high-ACV contracts alongside CEOs and enterprise buying committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Alliances &amp;amp; Channel Ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Amplification&lt;/strong&gt;: Consolidate strategic relationships with Global Systems Integrators (GSIs) and specialized agencies to co-create joint marketing strategies and drive indirect pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Market Voice &amp;amp; Strategic Direction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage market insights—captured through both marketing campaigns and direct sales engagements—to provide continuous feedback to the global Product teams, ensuring the rapid evolution of the &lt;strong&gt;VTEX B2B Suite&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Positioning&lt;/strong&gt;: Elevate VTEX’s visibility in North America as the undisputed benchmark for B2B digital transformation and the adoption of AI-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Profile Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Sales &amp;amp; Marketing Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: 5+ years of proven, hands-on experience aggressively leading full B2B sales cycles *AND* simultaneously directing B2B marketing strategies and teams (ideally within SaaS, Supply Chain, ERPs, or digital commerce environments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACV Scaling Track Record&lt;/strong&gt;: A demonstrable history of driving explosive and predictable ACV growth, with a proven ability to manage high-impact marketing budgets and complex P&amp;amp;L structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
