&lt;h2&gt;About VTEX CX Plataform&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vtex.com/pt-br/products/agentic-cx/&quot;&gt;VTEX CX Plataform i&lt;/a&gt;s a product of VTEX dedicated to enterprise customer experience solutions powered by artificial intelligence, designed for brands and retailers.&lt;/p&gt;
