&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced and strategic Sales Director to accelerate VTEX&#39;s growth in the Mexican enterprise market. This is a senior individual contributor role responsible for originating, developing, and closing high-value, complex enterprise opportunities with some of the country&#39;s leading retailers, brands, manufacturers, and distributors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Director, you will operate with a high degree of autonomy, owning the end-to-end sales strategy for your accounts, from identifying strategic opportunities and building executive relationships to structuring complex commercial proposals and leading high-stakes negotiations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond delivering your individual revenue targets, you will play a key role in shaping VTEX&#39;s enterprise sales approach in Mexico, influencing strategic account priorities, navigating competitive environments, and positioning VTEX as a long-term technology partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with Solution Engineers, Marketing, and Global Leadership, acting as a trusted advisor to senior executives and driving business outcomes through a consultative, value-based sales approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own strategic enterprise opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Independently lead the entire sales cycle for high-value, complex enterprise accounts, from strategic prospecting and opportunity creation through commercial negotiations and contract signature.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategic account development:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and prioritize high-potential enterprise accounts, develop comprehensive account penetration strategies, and proactively build a sustainable pipeline of strategic opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead complex sales engagements:&lt;/strong&gt; Navigate complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles involving C-level executives, procurement teams, IT leadership, and business decision-makers, aligning diverse interests to drive successful outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build executive-level relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain trusted relationships with senior business and technology leaders, positioning VTEX as a strategic partner in their digital commerce transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
