&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are proactively seeking a highly skilled Senior Backend Engineer to join our team. The ideal candidate will have experience in developing multi-tenant SaaS solutions and a proven track record in backend development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer, you will serve as a technical reference for the team, providing guidance and expertise in backend development best practices. You will be responsible for important evolutions of our products in terms of scalability (they&#39;re global products!)&amp;nbsp; and product evolution to address main customers demands and market opportunities. Your contributions will directly impact the success and global growth of our organization, making this a truly exciting opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Currently, we have various open positions available, and throughout the hiring process, we&#39;ll match candidates with teams based on their skills and identified level of seniority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have experience in building backend systems for large-scale applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have demonstrated experience in a technical guidance capacity, successfully guiding project teams and establishing strategic technical direction;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are proficient in multiple programming languages. While we remain language agnostic, it&#39;s worth mentioning that this team primarily works with C# as language of choice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Someone with academic background preferably in Engineering courses, such as Computer Engineering, Software Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Automation Engineering, or related fields.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have a proven track record of working with cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You thrive in dynamic environments and find them energizing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can effectively communicate in English and Portuguese;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are hands-on and curious about AI, using LLMs, automation, and design/dev tools to boost speed, quality, and clarity in your workflow, while staying thoughtful about their limitations, safety, and responsible use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About VTEX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c-mrkdwn__quote&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;quote&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;VTEX (NYSE: VTEX) is the composable and complete commerce platform that delivers more efficiency and less maintenance to organizations seeking to make smarter IT investments and modernize their tech stack. Through our pragmatic composability approach, we empower brands, distributors, and retailers with unparalleled flexibility and comprehensive solutions, enabling them to invest solely in what provides a clear business advantage and boosts profitability. VTEX is trusted by 2,400 global B2C and B2B customers, including Carrefour, Colgate, Motorola, Sony, Stanley Black &amp;amp; Decker, and Whirlpool, having 3,400 active online stores across 43 countries (as of FY ended on December 31, 2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c-mrkdwn__quote&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;quote&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Founded in the year 2000, VTEX has a history of being unstoppable. Completely against the odds, VTEX is leading a high-tech industry and positioned above market giants. We are building an extraordinary future with more than 1,300 employees scattered across 25 locations in 16 countries in Latin America, North America, Europe, and Asia. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vtex.com&quot;&gt;www.vtex.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;c-mrkdwn__quote&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;quote&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At VTEX, you will work in a challenge-driven environment and collaborate with amazing peers. If you are powerful individually, join us, and we will be unstoppable together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Annual profit-sharing program and equity eligibility;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Health, dental, and life insurance with national coverage provided by VTEX;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Annual budget for professional development in Tech;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Language development incentive program (English, Spanish, Portuguese);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible meal allowance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Extended parental leaves;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Child-care assistance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible work schedule and remote-first culture;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Financial assistance to build your work-from-home setup;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Wellness program;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Free shipping on 1000+ VTEX stores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;By applying for this position, the candidate acknowledges and explicitly affirms their understanding that the use of any form of artificial intelligence (AI) during the selection process is explicitly prohibited.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;37:1-37:205;3406-3610&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (Backend/Infrastructure) &lt;/strong&gt;for the VTEX Network team ,the core connective tissue of our cloud platform: CDN, Cloud Connectivity, Ingress, DNS, and Service Mesh.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:454;3612-4065&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll take on one of our hardest engineering challenges: evolving our Service Mesh. Today VTEX runs a custom, highly performant router (built in .NET) that acts as our service mesh, processing millions of requests per second as the backbone for every VTEX application. Your mission is to help evolve this mission-critical infrastructure toward a market-standard stack (like Istio) with zero downtime and the reliability thousands of stores depend on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:167;4067-4233&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This sits at the deep intersection of software engineering and scalable infrastructure, and it rewards real care for performance, resilience, and system architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Cloud Network team ensures the reliability, scalability, and performance of the platform that powers thousands of stores worldwide. As part of a recent transformation, we&#39;re building a new generation of infrastructure systems: Service Mesh, networking, and compute layers. Our goal is a platform where infrastructure complexity is abstracted away, so engineers move faster without trading off reliability or performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;47:1-47:123;4702-4824&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive the architectural evolution from our custom routing layer to a modern, market-standard Service Mesh (e.g., Istio);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;48:1-48:115;4825-4939&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain network components that sustain millions of requests per second at very low latency;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-49:143;4940-5082&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Keep VTEX&#39;s core network services (Ingress, DNS, Service Mesh, CDN) continuously available and resilient for thousands of stores globally;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;50:1-50:124;5083-5206&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply deep service-design principles to build scalable, robust, maintainable backend services and infrastructure tooling;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;51:1-51:202;5207-5408&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Use AI as a daily multiplier (for development, refactoring legacy internals, testing, and documentation) while exercising judgment about where it does and doesn&#39;t belong in critical infrastructure;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;52:1-52:140;5409-5548&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Raise the team&#39;s bar: mentor other engineers, document for both technical and non-technical audiences, and take an active part in hiring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;55:1-55:118;5566-5683&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A strong backend/platform engineer with deep, hands-on experience operating and evolving Kubernetes infrastructure;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;56:1-56:176;5684-5859&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve designed and run systems for mission-critical, high-throughput environments (millions of requests per second), and you&#39;re at home troubleshooting them under pressure;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;57:1-57:153;5860-6012&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You know service design and distributed systems well, including networking fundamentals (TCP/IP, HTTP, DNS, proxies) and microservices communication;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;58:1-58:247;6013-6259&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;re comfortable working inside complex legacy systems while building their replacement. Experience with .NET is a real plus for understanding and refactoring our current router; familiarity with Service Mesh (Istio, Envoy) is highly desired;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;59:1-59:157;6260-6416&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You treat ambiguous, high-stakes problems as yours to make precise, and you weigh decisions by their effect on the whole system, not just your component;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;60:1-60:108;6417-6524&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You use AI fluently in your own work and have a clear point of view on when it helps and when it doesn&#39;t;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;61:1-61:108;6525-6632&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You communicate and negotiate technical trade-offs clearly across teams, and with non-technical partners;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;62:1-62:59;6633-6691&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced English for our global, remote-first environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;HOW WE HIRE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our process is built for how engineers actually work in 2026: a take-home you complete with the AI tools you&#39;d really use, followed by a live session where we dig into your decisions and solve a problem together. We&#39;re far more interested in how you think than in whether you memorized an algorithm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
