&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;37:1-37:206;2788-2993&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Front-End Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to build commerce experiences used by thousands of stores across 43 countries, multi-tenant SaaS where a single front-end decision plays out at massive scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:375;2995-3369&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a technical reference for your team: setting front-end direction, leading real evolutions of our products, and working shoulder-to-shoulder with engineers, product managers, and designers to turn customer and market needs into shipped experiences. What you build runs 24/7 for businesses that depend on it, so performance, resilience, and craft are non-negotiable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
