&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Infrastructure/Software Engineer (Mid-Level/Senior) for the Compute team at VTEX. This team owns the platform&#39;s shared compute infrastructure: EKS clusters (including Dark Kitchen), the migration of the legacy Beanstalk environment, the internal networking layer (Private Link, VPC), traffic balancing (Janus, NLB/ALB), GitOps (ArgoCD), and the Core API.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will work on one of the company&#39;s most critical engineering challenges today: unlocking the definitive migration from legacy Beanstalk to EKS, while maintaining reliability and zero downtime for dozens of teams dependent on this infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Compute team is part of VTEX&#39;s Core Platform, ensuring the reliability, scalability, and performance of the compute infrastructure supporting the platform for thousands of stores. As part of a recent reorganization, the team is focused on consolidating the next generation of compute infrastructure, reducing technical debt from legacy platforms, and raising the self-service standard for teams that rely on it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Migrate and modernize critical infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly on migrating workloads from legacy Beanstalk to EKS, managing networking, IAM, and functional parity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build for scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and maintain compute and networking components (Private Link, load balancers, Core API) used simultaneously by multiple teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operate critical production systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure high availability and resilience of the shared compute infrastructure, including participating in on-call rotations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evolve GitOps and IaC:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and evolve ArgoCD/Argo Rollouts and the team’s infrastructure as code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-team collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical focal point for internal teams (Checkout, MasterData, Dark Kitchen, Traffic, among others) relying on Compute infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
