&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experienced backend/platform engineer with a solid track record operating and evolving Kubernetes/EKS infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with production AWS (VPC, IAM, load balancers, Auto Scaling/Beanstalk).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of distributed systems and networking (TCP/IP, DNS, proxies, inter-service communication).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with legacy systems in transition: experience migrating workloads between compute platforms is a major plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with GitOps and IaC (ArgoCD, Pulumi, or equivalent).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Effective communicator capable of negotiating technical priorities and collaborating with product teams and other platform squads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
